						"name": "False Accolades",
						"description": "After a poor performance, you found a script to a well-written play left in your dressing room. The accompanying note asked that if you performed the play, you should give the author credit. But after a commanding performance, you claimed to be star and playwright both - and the dark-side blight hidden in that script activated. A small portion of your skin has begun to fuse into cold, lifeless durasteel plating, and the only cure is to prove you have become selfless."
