						"description": "When outsiders arrived in your lands with the intent to exploit the wilds for their resources, you spoke out against them. However, several other rangers spoke in favor of these outsiders and allowed them in to despoil nature. Refusing to watch your homeland destroyed, you left. Now you help others avoid such a fate."
