						"description": "A disease has infected the lands you protect, causing animals to become violent and twisting plants into something dark and sinister. You’ve tried everything, Force-based and technological, to stop the scourge, but it continues to spread. As such, you’ve set out in search of a cure or an unblighted land to protect."
