			"name": "Warden",
			"description": "(Previously Conduit)\n\nWhether it flows from the Force or simply from skill and hard-won training, a deep well of power moves through you. Those who follow the Force often learn Ionize, a technique for controlling electrical energy. You can shape it into energetic barriers around your allies, or overload the circuits of droids and other machines. It's especially effective against droids, though it can sear living foes too, and it's the source of much of your ion damage. Those who don't channel the same effect through ion-charged gear and hard training. As a warden, you don't just keep your allies in the fight—you make them more effective, even as you turn that same power against your foes. Where others answer only to themselves, you answer to something greater.\n\nAs a warden, you heal and buff your allies, and debuff your foes while smiting them with your power. Something in you shines through in a crisis, filling your enemies with unease and making you more worldly and aware.",
