							"name": "Primordial Portal",
							"description": "\nAs a main action, you can touch a source of elemental power and use it to create a portal to your sanctuary — a hidden place beyond the reach of the world. You can then use a main action to teleport yourself and any willing creatures within 10 squares of you through the portal and into your sanctuary, or to teleport back again. You can maintain a number of portals equal to your Might score, each leading to the same sanctuary. If a portal in your network is destroyed, it is no longer part of the network. You can remove a portal from your network no matter your distance from it, including across different worlds (no action required).\n\n(Exploring beyond your sanctuary is possible, but continued safety is not guaranteed.)",
