			"name": "Adept",
			"description": "(Previously Talent)\n\nA rare few people are born with the potential to harness psionic power, but only those who experience an awakening, a significant event that activates an adept's abilities, can tap into the mind's full potential. You are one of those people—a master of psionics and a source of incredible power created through sheer force of will. You can move and change matter, time, gravity, the laws of physics, or another creature's mind.\n\nAs an adept, you are limited only by the strength of your mind. But the ability to wield multiple powers at once and change reality at will involves a gamble. Every manifestation has a chance of harming you, and adepts who use too much power too quickly pay a deadly price.",
