			"name": "Legion-Master",
			"description": "(Previously Summoner)\n\nYou are the armada. Warlords of old would trade whole armies for your abilities. You command a legion that never tires, however you call it to the field: reactivated droids, spawned abominations, or echoes of the dead.\n\nYou call forth minions to advance fearlessly into the fray and provide support, holding the enemy at bay while you and your fellow heroes ready the counteroffensive. Your minions serve unflinchingly, unerringly, to their end or yours.\n\nYou can also draw on the Force or hard-won technique to buff your allies, whittle down your enemies, or enlist the fallen into your ranks. And when push comes to shove, you can call upon your champion to finish the fight.",
