			"name": "Curse of Misfortune",
			"description": "You should have never pissed off that Sith! Maybe they deserved your ire, or maybe you were just a bully. But whatever the case, they hexed you with a dark-side jinx before leaving the system. Now, in moments of pressure that require great skill, you have a tendency to choke, falling and flailing in such a dramatic fashion that you take everyone with you.",
