		},
		{
			"id": "8eb3c53b-e588-4a9a-9cdb-f5274dcd4532",
			"name": "Beast-Mauled",
			"description": "\nAs a child, you survived a beast attack. But that attack left you with a toothy scar and the occasional fit of bloodlust.\n\nYou can’t take this complication if you can’t be made dazed.",
			"features": [
				{
