		{
			"id": "e1b5e45b-be4e-4c0a-8a98-3461ffa7b24c",
			"name": "Dark Bargain",
			"description": "You made a deal (perhaps unknowingly) with a dark-side broker that has tied you to their service. When you first learned of this deal, you were taken to a hidden Sith enclave, where some of the galaxy’s most dangerous minds taught you the ways of battle. The broker allows you to use these gifts as you will … until they require a favor from you.",
