			"id": "20e80b51-bf27-476f-9238-13399515e734",
			"name": "The Kyberheart Blade",
			"description": "This legendary hilt hums with the light of a captured star, and a brilliant blade springs forth the instant it is grasped by the right hand.",
			"type": "Artifact",
			"keywords": [
				"Magic",
				"Light Weapon",
				"Medium Weapon",
				"Heavy Weapon"
			],
			"crafting": null,
			"effect": "\nWhether salvaged from a fallen star, gifted by an ancient Force spirit, forged in the heart of a dying sun, or wielded to end a legend, there is a blade that exists outside of time and space. It is always where it needs to be precisely when it needs to be there--then is gone in a flash when the need for it has waned. The blade is depicted in art, song, and story across many living cultures—and even more frequently among cultures long buried, often after proving the deciding factor in a battle. It's been wielded by numerous heroes of legend, and even more who have slipped into the forgotten shadows of history.\n\nThough its size and make are often debated, the hilt is consistently described as forged from pure starlight. When wielded, a brilliant blade springs forth from that hilt, suiting the holder's taste in weapons. Those who touch the blade are filled with the vigor and power of the heroes who have held it before.",
