							"description": "This blade takes on the size, shape, and make that the wielder wills into it. It can be a light, medium, or heavy weapon, and you can change its weapon type and appearance as a free maneuver. Any weapon ability that deals rolled damage using the Kyberheart Blade always deals ion damage. Any creature with weakness to ion damage who takes damage from this weapon is also frightened and weakened until the end of their next turn.",
							"type": "Text",
